Sneaky Bears RollerCoaster", "keywords": ["roller", "coaster", "rollercoaster", "fast", "fly"], "long_description": "Ever wanted to try a DOUBLE LOOP on a Roller Coaster, but been too afraid to try? For the first time on VR, now you can!\nTake three crazy journeys at three different intensity levels on a conveyor belt coaster, roaming through the Sneaky Bears factory. And these teddy bears aren\u2019t having your average picnic!\n\nNo matter how adventurous you\u2019re feeling, we have the coaster for you!\n\nChilled: For those who want to explore this crazy factory and are a little scared of Coasters, this is a great way to ease your way into the fun.  \n\nBearable: Can you BEAR this one? For those folks with a little more adventure in them, let's see how you go!\n\nCrazy: A double loop, we'll say no more!\n\nMake your way through the Sneaky Bears factory on a crazy Coaster. Watch out for the flying bears!\n\nWe hope you like the experience and if you do, please don\u2019t forget to give us a review.\n\nEnjoy :)", "short_description": "Ever wanted to try a DOUBLE LOOP on a Roller Coaster, but been too afraid to try? For the first time on VR, now you can!\nTake three crazy journeys at three different intensity levels on a conveyor belt coaster, roaming through the Sneaky Bears factory. And these teddy bears aren\u2019t having your average picnic!\n\nMake your way through the Sneaky Bears factory on a crazy Coaster. Watch out for the flying bears!\n\nWe hope you like the experience and if you do, please don\u2019t forget to give us a review :)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/377885", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://globalagents.warducks.com/about/terms.html", "publisher_name": "WarDucks LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.sneakybearsvr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "conte